  (gr_text "ModuMIDI 2 bank board. Sensors U1-U30 (DRV5055, SOT-23) sit at the switch centres: U1-U10 white, U11-U20 black, U21-U30 grey.\nBoard edge = the bank outline (stepped tab and notch, seam edges inset 0.25 mm) trimmed front and back to fit the sensors. Bank.Outline layer = the full plate outline.\nBanks repeat every 228.60 mm (9.000 in), so neighbouring boards have a 0.50 mm gap. H1-H6: M2 (2.2 mm NPTH), 2.2 mm clear of the switches.\nF.SilkS: key-cap layout. F.Fab: 14 mm switch and 7 x 14 mm stabilizer housing outlines (housings inside the board need clearance under the plate)." (at 50 254.339999) (layer "Cmts.User") (tstamp e030f369-f228-444b-ba4b-619766278472)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (thickness 0.2)) (justify left top))
  )
